// A **qualified** attribute reference (`#[shapes.Marker]`) with no `use` bringing the module in
// is the same unresolved-import error a qualified type reference is (E0019): D2 made attribute
// names resolve through the same import machinery as types, so a spelled-out FQN needs its `use`.
// expect: error E0019 at 8:3
// expect: exit 1
// (No `namespace`: the entry of package `shapes` derives `shapes.main` from its own file name.)

#[shapes.Marker]
struct Thing { id: int }
